lineup Daily budget and payments

box queue as Waiting
box sent as Sent

item p1, p2, p3

gauge budget as Daily budget [on: sent, limit: 100, unit: USDC, over: Stopped over the limit]

step Line up
  say gauge places a gauge under the box that holds the amount. Before any set, the gauge starts at 0.
  line queue: p1, p2, p3

step Send two
  say set writes the total of the step, and the bar moves to that value.
  line queue: p3
  line sent: p1, p2
  set budget: 80

step Send the third
  say The part over the limit grows in red, and the over text shows under the gauge.
  line queue:
  line sent: p1, p2, p3
  set budget: 120
